To re-sync:
  git clone --depth 1 --branch claude/mortgage-subservicer-builder-y9nr7e \
    https://github.com/doug-ludlow/Supermortgage.git
  rsync -a --delete Supermortgage/src/kernel/ packages/kernel/src/kernel/
  cp Supermortgage/spec/registry/timers.json packages/kernel/spec/registry/
  then update Commit, Committed, Vendored and the hash above, and run
  npm test --workspace=@hm/kernel.
